Package: rester
Title: Estimate Sleep Stages and Respiratory Events from Accelerometry Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: 
    person(given = "John",
           family = "Muschelli",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           email = "muschellij2@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-6469-1750"))
Description: Wraps the 'AcceleRest' foundation model
    <https://github.com/NielsRLorenzen/AcceleRest> to estimate sleep
    stages and respiratory events from wrist-worn 'accelerometry' data.
    Provides functions to download the model code and pretrained
    weights and to run the model using 'reticulate'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
